{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium full-width hero image slider section for my Shopify sneaker brand “ROCKALS”.
    
    The section should be designed specifically for Shopify and should work properly with the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    Create 3 promotional slides.
    
    Slide 1:
    Small text: NEW LAUNCH OFFER
    Heading: Step Into Style
    Description: Flat 10% OFF on your first ROCKALS order.
    Button text: Shop Now
    Button link: /collections/all
    
    Slide 2:
    Small text: LIMITED TIME DEAL
    Heading: Flat ₹300 OFF
    Description: On orders above ₹2499. Upgrade your sneaker game today.
    Button text: Grab Offer
    Button link: /collections/all
    
    Slide 3:
    Small text: BEST SELLERS
    Heading: Most Selling Sneakers
    Description: Explore our customer-favourite ROCKALS collection.
    Button text: View Collection
    Button link: /collections/best-sellers
    
    Design the slider with a premium Nike/Adidas-style sneaker brand aesthetic.
    
    Requirements:
    
    - Full-width hero banner.
    - Desktop height around 520px.
    - Mobile height around 430px.
    - Use Shopify image picker for each slide.
    - Allow separate desktop and mobile images.
    - Background image should cover the complete banner without distortion.
    - Add a dark transparent left-to-right gradient overlay for readability.
    - Keep content positioned on the left side.
    - Use large bold white typography.
    - Main heading approximately 60px on desktop and 36px on mobile.
    - Small heading should be uppercase with wide letter spacing.
    - Description approximately 18px desktop and 15px mobile.
    - Add a white pill-shaped CTA button with black text.
    - Add a smooth hover animation to the button.
    
    Slider functionality:
    
    - Automatically change slides every 3.5 seconds.
    - Smooth fade transition between slides.
    - Infinite looping.
    - Add pagination dots at the bottom-left.
    - Active dot should be fully visible and inactive dots slightly transparent.
    - Pagination dots should be clickable.
    - Add optional previous and next arrows.
    - Pause autoplay when hovering on desktop.
    - Support swipe gestures on mobile if possible.
    
    Shopify customization settings:
    
    For every slide allow editing:
    - Desktop image
    - Mobile image
    - Small heading
    - Main heading
    - Description
    - Button text
    - Button link
    - Text position
    
    Section-level settings:
    - Desktop banner height
    - Mobile banner height
    - Overlay opacity
    - Autoplay on/off
    - Autoplay speed
    - Show/hide dots
    - Show/hide arrows
    - Heading size
    - Content width
    
    Make the section fully responsive and optimized for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    Keep all CSS and JavaScript scoped only to this Shopify section so it does not affect other sections.
    
    Do not use external slider libraries. Use lightweight Liquid, CSS and vanilla JavaScript.
    
    Make sure the slider works properly inside the Shopify Theme Editor and does not create duplicate autoplay intervals when the section is reloaded.
    
    The final result should look clean, premium, modern and visually strong for a sneaker e-commerce website.
    
    make sure it is customizable and also it should be 1600 × 900 px 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display: block; position: relative; width: 100%; height: {{ block.settings.desktop_height }}px; overflow: hidden; background: #030206; color: #fff; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__slides, .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__slide { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__slide { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transition: opacity .65s ease, visibility .65s ease; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__slide.is-active { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; z-index: 1; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #202020; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; opacity: .4; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,{{ block.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,{{ block.settings.overlay_opacity | times: 0.55 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 48%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%); }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content { position: relative; z-index: 2; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; height: 100%; width: {{ block.settings.content_width }}%; max-width: 1600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 6%; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content--center { align-items: center; text-align: center; margin: 0 auto; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content--right { align-items: flex-end; text-align: right; margin-left: auto; margin-right: 0; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow { margin: 0 0 18px; color: #fff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .22em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #fff; font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px; line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.04em; font-weight: 800; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 0 30px; color: #fff; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 28px; border-radius: 999px; background: #fff; color: #030206; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; transition: transform .25s ease, background-color .25s ease, color .25s ease; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); background: #f0ece3; color: #030206; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls { position: absolute; z-index: 4; left: 6%; right: 6%; bottom: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dots { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot { width: 34px; height: 3px; padding: 0; border: 0; background: rgba(255,255,255,.45); cursor: pointer; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot.is-active { background: #fff; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrows { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { width: 38px; height: 38px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7); border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(0,0,0,.18); color: #fff; cursor: pointer; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1; }
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:hover, .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:focus-visible { background: #fff; color: #030206; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} { height: {{ block.settings.mobile_height }}px; }
    .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content { width: 100%; padding: 32px 22px 74px; justify-content: flex-end; }
    .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content--right, .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content--center { align-items: flex-start; text-align: left; margin: 0; }
    .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { font-size: 36px; }
    .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description { font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls { left: 22px; right: 22px; bottom: 22px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__slide, .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button { transition: none; } }
{% endstyle %}

<rockals-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-autoplay="{{ block.settings.autoplay }}" data-speed="{{ block.settings.autoplay_speed | times: 1000 }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__slides">
    {% for i in (1..3) %}
      {% liquid
        assign desktop_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_desktop'
        assign mobile_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_mobile'
        assign eyebrow_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_eyebrow'
        assign heading_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_heading'
        assign description_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_description'
        assign button_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_button'
        assign link_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_link'
        assign position_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_position'
        assign desktop_image = block.settings[desktop_key]
        assign mobile_image = block.settings[mobile_key]
      %}
      <article class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__slide{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" data-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}" aria-hidden="{% if forloop.first %}false{% else %}true{% endif %}">
        {% if desktop_image or mobile_image %}<picture>{% if mobile_image %}<source media="(max-width: 749px)" srcset="{{ mobile_image | image_url: width: 1600 }}">{% endif %}{% if desktop_image %}<img class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media" src="{{ desktop_image | image_url: width: 2400 }}" alt="{{ desktop_image.alt | escape }}" width="1600" height="900" loading="{% if forloop.first %}eager{% else %}lazy{% endif %}">{% else %}<img class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media" src="{{ mobile_image | image_url: width: 1600 }}" alt="{{ mobile_image.alt | escape }}" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy">{% endif %}</picture>{% else %}<div class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}
        <div class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__overlay"></div>
        <div class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content--{{ block.settings[position_key] }}">
          <p class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings[eyebrow_key] }}</p>
          <h2 class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings[heading_key] }}</h2>
          <p class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description">{{ block.settings[description_key] }}</p>
          {% if block.settings[link_key] != blank %}<a class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button" href="{{ block.settings[link_key] }}">{{ block.settings[button_key] }}</a>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls">
    {% if block.settings.show_dots %}<div class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Hero slides">{% for i in (1..3) %}<button class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" type="button" data-slide="{{ forloop.index0 }}" role="tab" aria-label="Go to slide {{ i }}" aria-selected="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"></button>{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<span></span>{% endif %}
    {% if block.settings.show_arrows %}<div class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrows"><button class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-direction="prev" aria-label="Previous slide">&#8592;</button><button class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-direction="next" aria-label="Next slide">&#8594;</button></div>{% endif %}
  </div>
</rockals-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
(function(){
  class RockalsHero{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
    connectedCallback(){
      this.slides=[...this.querySelectorAll('.ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__slide')]; this.dots=[...this.querySelectorAll('.ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot')]; this.index=0; this.timer=null; this.startX=0;
      this.dots.forEach(dot=>dot.addEventListener('click',()=>this.go(Number(dot.dataset.slide))));
      this.querySelectorAll('[data-direction]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>this.go(this.index+(button.dataset.direction==='next'?1:-1))));
      this.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>this.stop()); this.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>this.start());
      this.addEventListener('touchstart',event=>{this.startX=event.changedTouches[0].screenX},{passive:true}); this.addEventListener('touchend',event=>{let distance=event.changedTouches[0].screenX-this.startX;if(Math.abs(distance)>45)this.go(this.index+(distance<0?1:-1));},{passive:true});
      this.start();
    }
    disconnectedCallback(){this.stop()}
    go(index){this.index=(index+this.slides.length)%this.slides.length;this.slides.forEach((slide,i)=>{slide.classList.toggle('is-active',i===this.index);slide.setAttribute('aria-hidden',i===this.index?'false':'true')});this.dots.forEach((dot,i)=>{dot.classList.toggle('is-active',i===this.index);dot.setAttribute('aria-selected',i===this.index?'true':'false')})}
    start(){this.stop();if(this.dataset.autoplay==='true'&&!window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches)this.timer=setInterval(()=>this.go(this.index+1),Number(this.dataset.speed))}
    stop(){if(this.timer){clearInterval(this.timer);this.timer=null}}
  }
  if(!customElements.get('rockals-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}'))customElements.define('rockals-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}',RockalsHero{{ ai_gen_id }});
})();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Rockals hero slider",
  "tag": null,
  "class": "rockals-hero-block",
  "settings": [
    {"type":"header","content":"Slider settings"},
    {"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},
    {"type":"range","id":"desktop_height","label":"Desktop height","min":400,"max":700,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":520},
    {"type":"range","id":"mobile_height","label":"Mobile height","min":320,"max":600,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":430},
    {"type":"range","id":"overlay_opacity","label":"Overlay opacity","min":40,"max":90,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":70},
    {"type":"range","id":"heading_size","label":"Heading size","min":40,"max":80,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":60},
    {"type":"range","id":"content_width","label":"Content width","min":40,"max":80,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":60},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"autoplay","label":"Autoplay slides","default":true},
    {"type":"range","id":"autoplay_speed","label":"Autoplay speed","min":2,"max":8,"step":1,"unit":"s","default":4},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_dots","label":"Show dots","default":true},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_arrows","label":"Show arrows","default":true},
    {"type":"header","content":"Slide 1"},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_1_desktop","label":"Desktop image"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_1_mobile","label":"Mobile image"},
    {"type":"text","id":"slide_1_eyebrow","label":"Small heading","default":"NEW LAUNCH OFFER"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_1_heading","label":"Main heading","default":"Step Into Style"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_1_description","label":"Description","default":"Flat 10% OFF on your first ROCKALS order."},{"type":"text","id":"slide_1_button","label":"Button text","default":"Shop Now"},{"type":"url","id":"slide_1_link","label":"Button link"},{"type":"select","id":"slide_1_position","label":"Text position","options":[{"value":"left","label":"Left"},{"value":"center","label":"Center"},{"value":"right","label":"Right"}],"default":"left"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Slide 2"},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_2_desktop","label":"Desktop image"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_2_mobile","label":"Mobile image"},
    {"type":"text","id":"slide_2_eyebrow","label":"Small heading","default":"LIMITED TIME DEAL"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_2_heading","label":"Main heading","default":"Flat ₹300 OFF"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_2_description","label":"Description","default":"On orders above ₹2499. Upgrade your sneaker game today."},{"type":"text","id":"slide_2_button","label":"Button text","default":"Grab Offer"},{"type":"url","id":"slide_2_link","label":"Button link"},{"type":"select","id":"slide_2_position","label":"Text position","options":[{"value":"left","label":"Left"},{"value":"center","label":"Center"},{"value":"right","label":"Right"}],"default":"left"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Slide 3"},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_3_desktop","label":"Desktop image"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_3_mobile","label":"Mobile image"},
    {"type":"text","id":"slide_3_eyebrow","label":"Small heading","default":"BEST SELLERS"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_3_heading","label":"Main heading","default":"Most Selling Sneakers"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_3_description","label":"Description","default":"Explore our customer-favourite ROCKALS collection."},{"type":"text","id":"slide_3_button","label":"Button text","default":"View Collection"},{"type":"url","id":"slide_3_link","label":"Button link"},{"type":"select","id":"slide_3_position","label":"Text position","options":[{"value":"left","label":"Left"},{"value":"center","label":"Center"},{"value":"right","label":"Right"}],"default":"left"}
  ],
  "presets": [{"name":"Rockals hero slider"}]
}
{% endschema %}